{"id":"ce269af4e544b5ee","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-qml-validity-sets.md","title":"Always Provable and Always True QML Sets","display":"df-qml-validity-sets — Always Provable and Always True QML Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-qml-validity-sets","aliases":["89-df-qml-validity-sets"],"display":"df-qml-validity-sets — Always Provable and Always True QML Sets","depends_on":["[[89-df-qml-realization]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-qml-validity-sets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-qml-validity-sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-qml-validity-sets — Always Provable and Always True QML Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee07d81809d76030\" href=\"?note=ee07d81809d76030\" title=\"89-df-qml-realization\">89-df-qml-realization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_Q:\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g_Q:\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为固定有效、可判定句子码集的 Gödel 编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_Q(S)\">\\(\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\)</span> 是给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中有限多个谓词指定对应元数算术公式的全部合法有限实现。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为固定算术理论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是下面定义的两类句子码集合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}validity\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AP}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau^Q_r(S))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AT}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^Q_r(S))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}validity\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AP}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau^Q_r(S))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AT}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^Q_r(S))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 17 章，印刷页 220,233–239；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n两者是自然数码集合；非合法句子码不属于任何一个。有限实现可有效枚举而整体全称量化是无限的。对象 PA 定理性、外部标准真与句子码集合属于三个不同层次。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-qml-realization","status":"resolved","id":"ee07d81809d76030","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-realization]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g_Q:\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_Q(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}validity\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AP}_Q&\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau^Q_r(S))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AT}_Q&\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^Q_r(S))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1489,"backlinks":[{"id":"73653f2b36e4ca9d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e0f03a34c592870","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-validity-sets]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-formula]] → [[89-df-open-provability-formula]] → [[89-df-qml-realization]] → [[89-df-qml-validity-sets]] → [[89-df-relative-completeness]] → [[89-thm-qml-complexity]] → [[89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable]]"}],"outgoing":["ee07d81809d76030"]}